[REQUIREMENT]
UID: PILOT-CUSTOM-FIELD-01
TITLE: Custom field probe
STATEMENT: StrictDoc shall parse a declared custom field in this fixed-version probe.
ACCEPTANCE: The StrictDoc 0.30.1 reader and native HTML exporter accept and render this value.
